      "summary": "Read to Wren.",
      "narrative_lines": [
        "You take a square of oatmeal-colored cloth out of your tote and draw it over the toy shelf. Wren watches. Then she tugs one corner so that it hangs evenly.",
        "Isla (to Wren): Stories first. Toys are sleeping.",
        "Wren (to Isla): It was crooked.",
        "You turn on the lamp by the beanbag and turn the overhead light off. The room gets smaller and warmer. Wren climbs onto the mustard cushion and pulls Rabbit into her lap."
